 class="neo-contact-field grid gap-2 yt-small font-black neo-contact-field--compact"><span class="sr-only sm:not-sr-only">Email</span><input type="email" required="" maxLength="254" autoComplete="email" placeholder="Email" class="neo-inset h-12 min-w-0 w-full rounded-xl px-4 yt-body font-medium outline-none focus:border-foreground" name="email"/></label></div><label class="grid gap-2 yt-small font-black neo-contact-field--compact"><span class="sr-only sm:not-sr-only">Message</span><textarea name="brief" required="" minLength="20" maxLength="1200" autoComplete="off" placeholder="Message" class="neo-inset min-h-28 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 font-medium outline-none focus:border-foreground"></textarea></label><button type="submit" class="neo-button neo-button--primary w-full">Send inquiry</button><p class="neo-contact-response yt-small font-bold neo-muted">edicutstudio@gmail.com · Replies within 24 hours</p></form></div></section></main><footer data-analytics-region="footer" class="neo-footer relative overflow-hidden border-t px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="neo-footer__inner mx-auto max-w-7xl pb-5 pt-8 sm:pb-7 sm:pt-12 md:pb-10 md:pt-14"><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-[minmax(18rem,1.45fr)_minmax(9rem,1fr)_minmax(11rem,1fr)] md:items-stretch"><section class="neo-footer__lead flex flex-col justify-between p-5 md:p-6"><div><h2 class="type-card-title neo-footer-ink">Plan your next video</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-md text-sm leading-5 neo-footer-muted sm:text-[15px]">Tell us your video format, footage, and deadline. We will help you choose an editing package.</p></div><a class="neo-button neo-button--dark neo-button--compact mt-6 w-fit" href="/contact" data-discover="true">Discuss your project</a></section><section class="neo-footer__group"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left text-sm font-bold neo-footer-ink md:pointer-events-none md:border-b md:border-[var(--neo-line)] md:pb-3">Explore<span class="footer-mobile-chev